## Modes

- `baseline`: `LossyInternalParams { cfl_two_pass: Some(false) }`
  (== pre-W44-102 default at e5/e6, no Pass-2)
- `widened`:  `LossyInternalParams { cfl_two_pass: Some(true) }`
  (== proposed new default at e5/e6, Pass-2 fires in fast mode since
   cfl_newton: effort >= 7 keeps Newton off at e5/e6)

5 trials per (cell, mode), interleaved. Bytes are deterministic —
sanity-checked across trials. Quality metrics computed on last-trial
bytes (also deterministic). encode_ms uses minimum across trials.

